      "content": "My friend, I can totally relate to feeling intimidated by the gym, especially when you're a beginner. But let me tell you, you're not alone, and I'm here to guide you through this journey. You're about to embark on a path that will transform your body and your mind, and I'm stoked to be your coach!\n\nNow, let's get down to business. I've got a simple 4-week linear progression plan for you, focusing on the basics: squats, bench press, and deadlifts. This will give you a solid foundation to build upon. Here's your daily plan:\n\nWeek 1:\n- Monday: Squats (3 sets of 8 reps)\n- Tuesday: Bench Press (3 sets of 8 reps)\n- Wednesday: Rest\n- Thursday: Deadlifts (3 sets of 8 reps)\n- Friday: Rest\n- Saturday: Squats (3 sets of 10 reps)\n- Sunday: Rest\n\nWeek 2:\n- Monday: Squats (3 sets of 10 reps)\n- Tuesday: Bench Press (3 sets of 10 reps)\n- Wednesday: Rest\n- Thursday: Deadlifts (3 sets of 10 reps)\n- Friday:",
